"普通充放电的空闲睡眠由上方选项控制。合盖主动放电需要系统睡眠保护；校准全程需要系统保护并保持显示器开启。启用充到上限保护后，温控暂停仍保留保护，航行保持和手动暂停则释放。所需保护必须在充放电命令前确认；接口不可用或控制失败时停止硬件控制并尝试恢复。物理效果仍待实测；拔线、完成、退出或心跳超时会尝试释放。" = "The idle-sleep option above applies to ordinary charging and discharge. Active discharge with a closed lid requires system-sleep protection; calibration requires system protection and an awake display throughout. With until-limit protection enabled, thermal pauses retain protection, while Sailing holds and manual pauses release it. Required protection must be confirmed before charging or discharge requests. Unavailable interfaces or failed control stop hardware control and attempt recovery. Physical effects still need testing. Unplugging, completion, exit, or heartbeat timeout attempts to release protection.";
